---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Homelab">
  <section class="mb-10">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Self-hosting</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">Personal Home Server Infrastructure</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base-content/70">
      My self-hosted server environment for learning, experimentation, and practical DevOps work.
      It includes service hosting, reverse proxying, HTTPS, DNS configuration, and containerized deployment.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card bg-base-200">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="card-title">Core stack</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-primary">Proxmox</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary">Docker</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary">Caddy</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary">Nextcloud</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary">DNS</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary">HTTPS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card bg-base-200">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="card-title">Architecture</h2>
        <pre class="rounded-box bg-base-300 p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>Internet
  ↓
Domain DNS
  ↓
Caddy reverse proxy
  ↓
Docker services
  ↓
Portfolio, Nextcloud, future services</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10">
    <div class="card bg-base-200">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="card-title">What this demonstrates</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-base-content/70">
          <li>Running services on my own infrastructure</li>
          <li>Containerized deployment with Docker</li>
          <li>Reverse proxying with Caddy</li>
          <li>HTTPS and DNS configuration</li>
          <li>Practical DevOps and server maintenance experience</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>